# A directory's entry whose first cluster is 0 (roadmap os-server.md P15,
# the second review; tests/posix/edges.c, EDGES_ZERODIR): only ".." may
# say the root so; B:\MANY's entry does, and is EIO (before, it was the
# root, and a rename of it wrote its ".." into the root's second entry,
# README.TXT's first cluster).
program: idle
define: TEST_POSIX_EDGES
define: EDGES_ZERODIR
media: B zerodir
keys: {wait 250}{wait 250}{wait 250}{wait 250}{wait 250}{wait 250}{wait 250}{wait 250}
match: contains
timeout: 120
emulators: bochs
---
edges: a name in a directory whose entry says cluster 0 (-1, EIO 5): -1, errno 5
edges: its listing (none, EIO 5): none, 5
edges: its rename (-1, EIO 5): -1, errno 5
edges: done
